gaEc(){return"Support Ishraqa"},
gaEd(){return"Knowledge doesn't grow through one person's effort, and it shouldn't stop with those who already have it."},
gaEe(){return"Ishraqa is free, and it will stay free, because we believe access to knowledge should never depend on the ability to pay."},
gaEf(){return"Ishraqa began with a simple idea: that reading can open a new door for a person, and that knowledge, when shared, reaches further than we imagine.\n\nFrom a small space for reading and conversation, a journey began to build a place that brings together knowledge, learning and expression, giving readers a chance to discover, learners a chance to grow, and developers a chance to make something new.\n\nBut ideas, however valuable, need someone to care for them so they can grow. They need technology that keeps running, content that keeps renewing, development that never stops, and human effort that turns an idea into an experience people benefit from.\n\nThat is why your support is not a price for using Ishraqa. It is a contribution to keeping it going and growing, enriching the knowledge it offers, and widening what it can open up for readers, learners and creators."},
