gaEy(){return"We are not here to ask you to pay for knowledge, but to open a chance for you to help make it available.\n\nWhat we plant in our minds today may become an idea someone develops tomorrow, a solution someone else builds, or knowledge passed from one generation to the next.\n\nIshraqa is a growing project, and every sincere contribution can be part of its journey."},
